<title>INDIA: Indian four-year bond auction results delayed-RBI.</title>
<headline>Indian four-year bond auction results delayed-RBI.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of a four-year government bond auction held by the Reserve Bank of India on Monday will be available only after 1900 hours local (1330 gmt), a central bank spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
